&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be the Single-Threaded Owner (STO) for multiple squads: their engineers and tech leads report to you, and you work alongside product, architecture, and delivery peers. Hire strong engineers, develop them through coaching and clear feedback, and manage performance directly. Own the org design, headcount planning, and engineering culture for your group, building a team that raises its own bar rather than depending on you.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
