&lt;li&gt;Champion and evolve Client&#39;s brand system, keeping it contemporary, distinctive, and appropriate for a regulated sector environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple concurrent projects across the portfolio, balancing hands-on creative contribution with leadership responsibilities and proactive problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with OLIVER&#39;s wider creative and account leadership to identify opportunities to grow the studio&#39;s offering and deepen the Client relationship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee studio-level production budgets — including cost estimation, supplier relationships, and spend reporting — ensuring financial performance aligns with Client and OLIVER expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive responsible integration of AI tools across studio workflows, setting quality standards and governance that preserve craft excellence while improving efficiency&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you need to be great in this role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio of sophisticated brand and campaign work, with particular depth in B2B, corporate, or professional services environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level understanding of brand systems — how to build, maintain, and evolve them within complex, regulated contexts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading and developing creative teams, with a coaching approach that brings out the best in people at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience presenting creative work to executive and partner-level audiences, with the presence and communication skills to hold a room and advocate for ideas with conviction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep craft knowledge across print and digital — typography, layout, art direction, and visual storytelling — with the ability to contribute hands-on when the work demands it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign) and familiarity with Figma and contemporary design tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing studio-level or project-level production budgets, including supplier relationships and cost oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating AI tools strategically across studio projects and operations, with the ability to set quality standards and governance at studio level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear understanding of where AI enhances creative output — and where human craft and judgement remain essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drives thoughtful AI adoption within the team, maintaining rigorous human oversight and mentoring others in responsible, effective use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agentic approach to complex creative and business challenges: systematic, adaptive, and focused on outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
